**One process note worth flagging:** Step 7's final `results.{1..8}.json` weren't left on disk, so I re-ran the sweep to verify and regenerate them. My first attempt mistakenly used `--start-command "bash start.sh"` (relying on an outer `cd`) and got a misleading **72/72 errors** in all rounds — "API server could not be restarted." The runner doesn't inherit the launcher's cwd, so `start.sh` wasn't found. Re-running with the template's embedded form `--start-command "cd <impl> && bash start.sh"` gave a clean 72/72 in all 8 rounds. The implementation was healthy the whole time; I've saved this gotcha to memory so it's caught faster next time.

Final artifacts are all present under `tasks/task_0082_newborn_parenting_registry/` (scaffolds, worklog, test_helpers/, test_suite/, workspace/{PRD.md, PRD_FINALIZED.md, PRD_COMPLETED.md, implementation/ + results.1–8.json}).
